      <title>微软解释32位Windows限制4GB内存：并非技术限制而是驱动程序不可靠</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260912/%E5%BE%AE%E8%BD%AF%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A32%E4%BD%8DWindows%E9%99%90%E5%88%B64GB%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%B9%B6%E9%9D%9E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0/</link>
